{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15525","headline":"春日过奉诚园 · 畅当","name":"春日过奉诚园","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"帝里阳和日，游人到御园。\n暖催新景气，春认旧兰荪。\n咏德先臣没，成蹊大树存。\n见桐犹近井，看柳尚依门。\n献地非更宅，遗忠永奉恩。\n又期攀桂後，来赏百花繁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"畅当","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15525.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15525","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}